# Authorship canonicalisation. GitHub's rebase-merge sets the committer to the
# account's email (geokkjer@gmail.com) while local agent-commit runs set it to the
# project address (geir@geokkjer.eu) — one person, two records. `git shortlog -sne`,
# `git log --use-mailmap` and `git blame` fold them together; no history is rewritten.
Geir Okkenhaug Jerstad <geir@geokkjer.eu> <geokkjer@gmail.com>
